{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hangman Pro brings the nostalgic thrill of word guessing to life, making every letter count. Feel the tension build with each wrong guess as you race to solve the puzzle before it\u2019s late.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933950/extras/074be78835469bf49e727db771253aca.poster.avif?t=1772546615\" width=600 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933950/extras/074be78835469bf49e727db771253aca.webm?t=1772546615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933950/extras/074be78835469bf49e727db771253aca.mp4?t=1772546615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Hangman Pro</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hangman Pro features a clean, hand-drawn minimalist style that puts the spotlight on gameplay. It offers three difficulty levels for general trivia words, plus a special category dedicated to historical soccer terms for added variety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933950/extras/eb878986a4f64744bed122c3edb364a7.poster.avif?t=1772546615\" width=600 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933950/extras/eb878986a4f64744bed122c3edb364a7.webm?t=1772546615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933950/extras/eb878986a4f64744bed122c3edb364a7.mp4?t=1772546615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Fatures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can enjoy a smooth guessing experience with responsive controls and clear feedback. The game challenges your vocabulary and knowledge across different topics, making each round both fun and mentally engaging.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3933950?t=1772546615","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3933950?t=1772546615","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933950/115c3488e269b925f9794a3f5ce0bfade697fa65/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772546615","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933950/115c3488e269b925f9794a3f5ce0bfade697fa65/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772546615","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Hangman Pro</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933950/extras/0f0c3edd22323d3e7163c15671c1bc37.avif?t=1772546615\" width=600 height=190 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hangman Pro brings the nostalgic thrill of word guessing to life, making every letter count. Feel the tension build with each wrong guess as you race to solve the puzzle before it\u2019s late.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933950/extras/074be78835469bf49e727db771253aca.poster.avif?t=1772546615\" width=600 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933950/extras/074be78835469bf49e727db771253aca.webm?t=1772546615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933950/extras/074be78835469bf49e727db771253aca.mp4?t=1772546615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Hangman Pro</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hangman Pro features a clean, hand-drawn minimalist style that puts the spotlight on gameplay. It offers three difficulty levels for general trivia words, plus a special category dedicated to historical soccer terms for added variety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933950/extras/eb878986a4f64744bed122c3edb364a7.poster.avif?t=1772546615\" width=600 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933950/extras/eb878986a4f64744bed122c3edb364a7.webm?t=1772546615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933950/extras/eb878986a4f64744bed122c3edb364a7.mp4?t=1772546615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Fatures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can enjoy a smooth guessing experience with responsive controls and clear feedback. The game challenges your vocabulary and knowledge across different topics, making each round both fun and mentally engaging.</p>","developers":["Hard Shark Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933950/1cb7564d88bbc0524707bce96e7b5be3a5c1939b/header.jpg?t=1772546615","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Hard Shark Games. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requireme